Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.94,0:00:03.45,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.91,0:00:06.60,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You sure you've got Wrath and not Gluttony?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.56,0:00:09.45,main,Fate,0,0,0,,He gave us all those supplies...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:12.41,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Just how much do you need to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.94,0:00:15.50,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Rage burns a lot of calories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.67,0:00:19.24,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You guys did this already.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.89,0:00:20.60,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.94,0:00:24.18,main,Myne,0,0,0,,You can have some, so don't get mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.18,0:00:25.55,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Say, "Ahh."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.55,0:00:27.14,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Ahh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.51,0:00:29.04,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Now chew.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.47,0:00:33.10,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.05,0:00:36.67,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What's with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:45.16,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Uh... Why are you sleeping on my lap?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:49.15,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Floor's too hard to sleep on. \NThis bed's decent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.54,0:00:51.14,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Well, excuse me for only being decent!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.14,0:00:53.59,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Worst part is it won't shut up...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.59,0:00:55.12,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Listen, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.35,0:01:00.41,main,Fate,0,0,0,,And she's already asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.20,0:01:04.85,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Looking at her now, she seems like a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.96,0:01:10.10,flashback,Myne,0,0,0,,I'm a phantom who's not allowed to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.58,0:01:13.84,flashback,Myne,0,0,0,,There's something I need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.69,0:01:19.71,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Say, Greed... what exactly \Nis she fighting against?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.67,0:01:24.25,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Are you clamming up \Nwhen you actually know again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:29.19,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Maybe. But if you keep\N traveling together, you'll get an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.19,0:01:31.18,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Just don't dig too deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.74,0:01:35.77,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Well, that reeks of trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.84,0:01:48.76,main,Miria,0,0,0,,When are we going to reach Galia, Lady Roxy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.76,0:01:51.82,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,We should be nearing the border already.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.82,0:01:52.97,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Mugan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.97,0:01:55.41,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,Right. We're almost at Hausen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.56,0:03:29.98,sign_harsh_red,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(400,400\blur1)\c&H0E00DD&\pos(473.437,285)}The Village of Lost Memories
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.34,0:03:31.07,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Wow! Look at that castle, Lady Roxy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.41,0:03:34.18,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,This is the seat of \Nthe Barbatos lands, Hausen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.18,0:03:36.98,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I recall Sir Aaron previously lived there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:37.99,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Previously?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.99,0:03:40.45,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Who's the lord of the castle now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.74,0:03:45.66,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I believe a lich lord crowned\N beast has taken it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:48.07,main,Miria,0,0,0,,A c-crowned beast?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.07,0:03:50.02,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,Yeah. Apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.45,0:03:54.99,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Looking up close, it's all busted up...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.91,0:03:58.14,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,But I don't sense a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.41,0:04:01.54,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,Seems like it must've \Nbeen liberated recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.30,0:04:04.77,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,Welcome to Hausen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.31,0:04:06.98,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,I am Aaron Barbatos.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.47,0:04:09.54,main,Miria,0,0,0,,You didn't retire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:10.64,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Miria...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:14.04,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,It's an honor, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:15.65,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd ever meet Aaron Barbatos,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.65,0:04:19.27,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,head of the Barbatos family, \None of the five great estates,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.27,0:04:22.17,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,and the expert swordsman \Ncalled the Blade of Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.94,0:04:26.14,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I apologize for the sudden intrusion. I'm—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.14,0:04:29.08,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,You certainly have grown, Roxy Hart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.08,0:04:32.04,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,You know of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.04,0:04:35.85,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,I'm an old acquaintance of Mason and Aisha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.85,0:04:39.31,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,They actually asked me to name you \Nwhen you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.09,0:04:44.10,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I never knew! My parents \Nhadn't mentioned that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.36,0:04:49.60,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,I'm jealous, Lady Roxy! \NYou were named by a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:50.48,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Truly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.48,0:04:52.15,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,Former hero, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.15,0:04:56.18,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,Surely you've heard \Nthe reason I retired, Roxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.18,0:04:57.22,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.61,0:04:59.85,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,With the loss of those \NI should have protected,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.85,0:05:02.20,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,I no longer have a reason to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.21,0:05:08.06,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,But... you did dispose of the lich lord, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.70,0:05:11.12,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,Not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.49,0:05:18.32,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,It's thanks to the man who fought at my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.13,0:05:21.62,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,Even if you were fighting together,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.62,0:05:25.40,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,he must be quite the talented warrior \Nto slay a crowned beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.40,0:05:29.40,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Where is this guy? I wanna meet him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.40,0:05:30.77,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,He's taken his leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.77,0:05:34.12,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Could you tell me his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:38.48,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I'll need to report to the capital how \Nthe lich lord has been driven from Hausen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.82,0:05:41.45,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,Sadly, I can't do that, Roxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.06,0:05:47.49,flashback,Fate,0,0,0,,If someone comes here asking about me, \Nwould you tell them you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.02,0:05:50.50,flashback,Fate,0,0,0,,Sorry to ask you such a weird request...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.14,0:05:55.45,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,He requested I keep his name \Na secret. My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.89,0:05:57.54,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.54,0:06:01.16,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I understand. And I beg your \Npardon for the intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.16,0:06:02.53,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.53,0:06:04.22,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,You're heading to Galia?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.22,0:06:07.64,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,How did you know that? I never mentioned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.64,0:06:13.85,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,I can only imagine one reason a young \Nholy knight like yourself would be out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.85,0:06:16.31,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,Did the Vlericks send you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.90,0:06:19.78,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,No, sir. I volunteered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.17,0:06:22.63,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,You were manipulated into doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.63,0:06:26.49,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,The Harts and the Barbatoses \Nhave always been annoyances.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.49,0:06:29.12,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Regardless, I will protect the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.12,0:06:31.50,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I have simply inherited my father's ideals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:33.82,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,Mason's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.47,0:06:40.25,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,Would you be willing \Nto accept my instruction?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.93,0:06:43.68,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,I'll teach you how to fight in Galia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.68,0:06:48.64,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,I did give you that name, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.62,0:06:54.10,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I couldn't ask for more! Yes, gladly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.71,0:06:59.23,main,Miria,0,0,0,,This isn't what I signed up for!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.23,0:07:01.58,main,Muigan,0,0,0,,Quit whining and keep working, Miria!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.12,0:07:08.28,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,I can see Mason's teachings \Nin your swordplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.86,0:07:11.70,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,Very good. You've got a good touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.70,0:07:14.25,main,Aaron,0,0,0,,And I like the look in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.61,0:07:18.25,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I need to become much stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.66,0:07:20.37,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,To protect everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.28,0:07:27.53,main,Fate,0,0,0,,We've been walking since the last stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.53,0:07:29.18,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What is this place, Myne?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.57,0:07:33.41,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It looks abandoned... \Nor maybe more like ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.95,0:07:37.11,main,Myne,0,0,0,,This is where I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.44,0:07:42.45,main,Myne,0,0,0,,I was taken to the imperial capital right \Nafter I was born, so I don't remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.45,0:07:44.55,main,Myne,0,0,0,,But it's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.02,0:07:46.57,main,Fate,0,0,0,,The imperial capital...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.91,0:07:50.11,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I thought Galia collapsed 4,000 years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.11,0:07:51.37,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.25,0:07:53.17,main,Myne,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.16,0:08:02.17,main,Fate,0,0,0,,A cocoon...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.17,0:08:05.57,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Great. I can't believe one survived...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.45,0:08:09.03,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Greed, what is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.03,0:08:10.27,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,A chimera.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.97,0:08:15.36,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,It was a biological weapon\N Galia's military tested out in the old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.36,0:08:19.10,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,They take a vessel and \Nessentially sew monsters into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.41,0:08:20.81,main,Fate,0,0,0,,A chimera...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.81,0:08:23.08,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,It's a damn failure is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.35,0:08:26.07,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,And they were supposed to \Nhave all been shut down...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.71,0:08:29.28,main,Myne,0,0,0,,It's time you paid me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.28,0:08:31.27,main,Fate,0,0,0,,So, we're fighting this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.16,0:08:37.45,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\fs23\pos(317.057,37.79)}Chimera Haniel
