Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.16,0:08:37.45,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(141.165,240.494)}Agility:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.16,0:08:37.45,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H090203&\fade(500,1)\pos(141.883,270.714)}[Skills]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.19,0:08:35.08,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Chimera... Haniel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.56,0:08:37.45,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's giving me an error for its skills!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.45,0:08:41.95,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,All those monsters mixed together\N mean it's too unstable to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:45.08,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Those are some incredible stats, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.71,0:08:48.26,main,Myne,0,0,0,,This one's still in a larval state, \Nso we can beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:49.84,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's not fully grown?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.51,0:08:52.58,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What do I need to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.38,0:08:57.22,main,Myne,0,0,0,,As long as its soul is intact, you can \Ndamage its body, but it won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.22,0:08:58.70,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Its soul...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:03.97,main,Fate,0,0,0,,So you want me to use the soul-eating \Npart of Gluttony's power?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.97,0:09:09.28,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Right. The most sinful and heretical \Nof all the Skills of Deadly Sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:10.70,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Okay, battle starts now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.91,0:09:12.66,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What a jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.88,0:09:31.59,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Th-This is a chimera...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.01,0:09:39.01,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Why's there a person in its chest?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.01,0:09:44.80,main,Fate,0,0,0,,The same red eyes I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.90,0:09:48.39,main,Myne,0,0,0,,It was just intimidating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.39,0:09:52.02,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Come on, don't look right at her, \Nor you'll be too frozen up to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.61,0:09:54.05,main,Myne,0,0,0,,That's just sad...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:56.98,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Myne, just who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.98,0:09:58.37,main,Myne,0,0,0,,The core of the chimera.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.17,0:10:01.58,main,Myne,0,0,0,,I need you to finish her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.02,0:10:04.79,main,Fate,0,0,0,,But... if I eat her soul...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.79,0:10:09.62,main,Fate,0,0,0,,She'll be suffering in eternal \Ntorment forever, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.76,0:10:12.29,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I can't do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.63,0:10:14.71,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Don't let appearances fool you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.71,0:10:18.11,main,Myne,0,0,0,,That's nothing more than a monster \Nwearing human skin at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.50,0:10:20.26,main,Myne,0,0,0,,There's no other way to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.95,0:10:23.52,main,Myne,0,0,0,,If you keep being naive, you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.02,0:10:36.72,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Greed! I need the black scythe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.72,0:10:39.93,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,This magic attack works indirectly \Nby doing damage with the lava!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.93,0:10:42.08,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,The black scythe won't be able to cut it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.15,0:10:44.92,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Myne?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.92,0:10:46.80,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Stay back, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:10:58.72,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Damn...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:10:59.93,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Let's split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.93,0:11:01.14,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.60,0:11:11.70,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.82,0:11:16.34,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Good! The petrifying magic arrows worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.34,0:11:17.40,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That should slow her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.40,0:11:19.99,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa, it's a little \Ntoo soon to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.42,0:11:28.47,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,She can regenerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.72,0:11:34.80,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,A weapon capable of non-stop fighting \Nwith no support... That's what a chimera is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:37.84,main,Fate,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to beat it, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.49,0:11:47.54,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Is Myne hitting harder than before?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:52.74,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Yeah. Sloth becomes heavier\N and more powerful with every swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.05,0:11:57.05,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,The downside being how it cuts down \Non your agility in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.64,0:12:06.82,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What's this bizarre pressure?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.93,0:12:09.29,main,Myne,0,0,0,,It's undergoing metamorphosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.24,0:12:18.60,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Get behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.04,0:12:26.42,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Am I being protected again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.46,0:12:32.72,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Can I really hold my head high and claim \Nto be helping Lady Roxy like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.18,0:12:34.38,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I want to change...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:37.53,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I want to be someone with power, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.72,0:12:41.81,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Myne. I'm going to go \Ninto a half-starvation state.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.08,0:12:47.95,main,Myne,0,0,0,,If you're not careful and tap too deeply, \NGluttony will overwhelm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.95,0:12:50.24,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yeah. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.24,0:12:52.55,main,Fate,0,0,0,,But at this rate, I'll be useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.59,0:12:59.00,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,If I screw this up, it's over...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.56,0:13:01.06,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Have to control it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.10,0:13:10.86,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Myne.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.43,0:13:12.44,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.01,0:13:17.44,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You don't have to act so surprised. \NDid you really think I couldn't do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.07,0:13:20.45,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Now... let's start fighting back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.78,0:13:26.91,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Feathers?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.91,0:13:28.87,main,Myne,0,0,0,,They explode on contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.98,0:13:32.46,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Perfect. I'll make good use of them, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.27,0:13:35.96,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Clever! I think I get what you're after!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.35,0:13:38.17,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Then let's get right to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.17,0:13:40.14,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,And it's in the perfect position!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.14,0:13:42.09,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Let's throw Sandstorm on there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.09,0:13:44.02,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Take 10% of my stats!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.02,0:13:45.09,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.09,0:13:46.64,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Bloody Ptarmigan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.31,0:13:53.31,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.31,0:13:55.02,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Sloth, awaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:04.16,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Damn, that's powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.16,0:14:06.41,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Hey, stupid! This is no time to be impressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.41,0:14:08.33,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Let's end this before it can regenerate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.33,0:14:09.17,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.29,0:14:17.43,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Huh, a barrier created with a skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.75,0:14:20.63,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Sounds like a job \Nfor the black scythe, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.63,0:14:27.35,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Even the black scythe can't get through?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.95,0:14:31.26,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You need to read the flow of magic power \Nand aim for the weakest point!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.26,0:14:32.31,main,Fate,0,0,0,,The flow of magic power?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.36,0:14:37.47,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That must be it! The weak point...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.77,0:14:39.73,main,Fate,0,0,0,,is right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.60,0:14:49.99,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Stop! Don't look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.99,0:14:51.20,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Fate, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.14,0:15:00.17,main,Fate,0,0,0,,She's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.21,0:15:05.28,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Looks like you're reaching your limit...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.19,0:15:07.72,main,Myne,0,0,0,,No time. Get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.72,0:15:09.47,main,Fate,0,0,0,,On the axe...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.47,0:15:12.39,main,Myne,0,0,0,,I'll send you into the sky with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.53,0:15:14.31,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.31,0:15:16.83,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Before Haniel recovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:17.77,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Got it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.75,0:15:30.79,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Just wondering, how do we \Nbeat her once we catch up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.79,0:15:33.82,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Great news! You can now use my \Nsecond level's secret technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.82,0:15:35.05,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,How's 20% of your stats sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.05,0:15:36.64,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Fine, take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.46,0:15:44.05,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Aim for where the center \Nof the magic power is!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.05,0:15:45.92,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Look carefully, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.92,0:15:47.05,main,Fate,0,0,0,,The center...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.17,0:15:49.91,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Where the magic power is flowing from.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.05,0:15:55.18,main,Fate,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.52,0:15:58.85,main,Fate,0,0,0,,She caught me in the barrier?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.73,0:16:03.66,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,This is bad! Haniel's going to cook \Nherself and take you with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.07,0:16:07.13,main,Greed,0,0,0,,Then we feast before we burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.13,0:16:08.78,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Listen to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.74,0:16:12.11,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.99,0:16:17.12,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Deadly Inferno!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:43.76,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,What is this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.76,0:16:46.26,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Did my Telepathy skill activate?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.87,0:17:05.01,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.41,0:17:24.82,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.32,0:17:28.15,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm not feeling the usual exhilaration...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.29,0:17:32.30,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,If anything, there's this... \Nchest-tightening sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.95,0:17:34.45,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,That sounds right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.51,0:17:38.92,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Deteriorated or not, you did \Njust eat one of your own kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.92,0:17:40.93,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,There's no pleasure to be had there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.93,0:17:42.14,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,One of my own...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.45,0:18:04.28,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Did you know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.51,0:18:07.82,main,Myne,0,0,0,,I've forgotten what happened \Nall those years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.51,0:18:09.36,main,Myne,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.19,0:18:15.81,main,Myne,0,0,0,,If someone becomes a chimera, \Nyou have to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.94,0:18:19.93,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Otherwise, even more people die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.02,0:18:24.35,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,That could be me one day...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.50,0:18:28.64,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Hey, Myne. I'd like to ask a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.27,0:18:30.13,main,Myne,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.03,0:18:33.05,main,Fate,0,0,0,,If I ever lose control of myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.19,0:18:39.66,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Please, kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.23,0:18:43.13,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You're the only one who can \Nstop me if I go berserk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.13,0:18:45.52,main,Fate,0,0,0,,So... please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.76,0:18:55.81,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Myne?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.54,0:19:00.45,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Okay. If it happens, I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.00,0:19:03.04,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.15,0:19:05.24,main,Fate,0,0,0,,And thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.86,0:19:13.77,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm heading on to Babylon. What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.14,0:19:16.26,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Still have work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:20.81,main,Myne,0,0,0,,I promised the others I'd build \Na village just for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.28,0:19:23.54,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You actually meant that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.54,0:19:25.18,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Before we meet again...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.98,0:19:27.14,main,Myne,0,0,0,,I get the feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.30,0:19:29.77,main,Myne,0,0,0,,You'll be dead, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:34.93,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Ta-da! Say hello to level 3, \Nthe magic shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.25,0:19:40.78,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Unlocking a new level in a place \Nlike this, resetting all your stats...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.51,0:19:42.86,main,Myne,0,0,0,,It's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.86,0:19:44.31,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, Myne!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.31,0:19:46.83,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Could you help me hunt so \NI can get my stats back up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.83,0:19:48.47,main,Myne,0,0,0,,For how many gold coins?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.47,0:19:51.31,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Ugh, you... you're so stingy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.31,0:19:52.38,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Sure am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.74,0:20:00.47,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,This is Babylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.85,0:20:04.57,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,The bulwark between the kingdom and \NGalia... the Sentinel City, Babylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.32,0:20:09.19,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,The walls, made out of adamantine alloy, \Nhave lasted for millennia
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.19,0:20:11.69,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,against the attacks of Galia's monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.07,0:20:15.42,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Wait, why are you going that way? \NOther way around!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.42,0:20:17.15,main,Fate,0,0,0,,There's gotta be a gate \Non the south side, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.15,0:20:19.56,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,There's only a northern gate for Babylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.56,0:20:21.44,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Galia's to the south, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.44,0:20:23.39,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Why would you build a gate there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.39,0:20:26.50,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,It'd practically be an opening \Nfor monsters to get in through.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.50,0:20:29.39,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You seem well-informed. \NHave you been here before?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.39,0:20:32.21,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Well, a little bit, \Nwith my previous wielder.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.58,0:20:36.83,main,Fate,0,0,0,,If they wielded you, Greed, \Ndid they have a Skill of Deadly Sin too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.83,0:20:41.18,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Yep, but they up and died,\N left me behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.59,0:20:42.69,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:47.35,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Humans are mortal. \NThat means dying one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.35,0:20:48.67,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,That's just how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.31,0:20:53.25,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Not that being immortal \Nis all roses, mind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.25,0:20:55.23,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You're always having to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.23,0:20:56.82,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.41,0:21:00.11,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Wait, you can't die?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.11,0:21:02.49,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Didn't I mention it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.49,0:21:04.79,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,The Weapons of Mortal Sin \Ncan't be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.79,0:21:06.00,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.00,0:21:09.66,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Hey, look there. That's \Nthe northern gate of Babylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.28,0:21:14.27,main,Fate,0,0,0,,The meat skewers cost five times \Nas much as in the capital?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.27,0:21:15.85,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Cost comes from extra work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.85,0:21:19.12,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,It's quite a trek to get supplies \Nall the way down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.12,0:21:20.34,main,Northern,0,0,0,,Make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.80,0:21:25.44,main,Northern,0,0,0,,Babylon's new lord has come \Nfrom the royal capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.60,0:21:29.93,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That emblem... Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.93,0:21:33.03,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You're too worked up. Settle down some.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.03,0:21:34.40,main,Fate,0,0,0,,How could I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.72,0:21:38.15,main,Crowd,0,0,0,,It's Lady Roxy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.57,0:21:40.85,main,Crowd,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.85,0:21:44.73,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Well, go on, Fate, wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.73,0:21:46.24,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.68,0:21:48.11,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Going to die...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.69,0:21:53.08,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Did I just imagine that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.06,0:21:57.64,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Roxy...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.42,0:22:02.34,main,Eris,0,0,0,,is going to die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.47,0:23:40.19,sign_harsh_red,Next Eptitle,0,0,0,,{\fade(400,1)\3c&H000100&\fs30\blur1\pos(319.641,145.329)}The Guardian of Lust
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.09,0:23:38.18,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,"The Guardian of Lust."
